        <p id="Example3-config">
          To configure the check for operators at the beginning of a line:
        </p>
        <macro name="example">
          <param name="path"
                 value="resources/com/puppycrawl/tools/checkstyle/checks/whitespace/operatorwrap/Example3.java"/>
